{"posts":[{"id":"3drive_p9_201","t":"Continuation....","a":"Nehru82T","d":"","n":"#201","p":9,"im":["3a93e7953cbd7694dae9165d8af961dccebb2ef3","635d485898356d995b8e7890dc912183cb2198d8"],"m":201},{"id":"3drive_p9_202","t":"hi RTMs\n\nwhere do we look for 3Drives? yeah always lookin for them on the right places\n\nProper S/D zones\n\nas IF said: WE WANT TO SEE COMPRESSION IN ACTION","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#202","p":9,"im":["70a9de60ff10274a061d7eadf5546da350a0d522"],"m":202},{"id":"3drive_p9_203","t":"another one\n\n3Drive shows that price advances are slowing down\n\nwhere do we look for them?\n\nIn the proper S/D zones","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#203","p":9,"im":["aab31a991a11faff07225bca99c6bb8995d85f20"],"m":203},{"id":"3drive_p9_204","t":"hi\n\n3Drive on Gold Daily","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#204","p":9,"im":["a7ccf6c8f7538619df0e7f633d4cd15ab70f29e1"],"m":204},{"id":"3drive_p9_205","t":"hey it's me again i think a 3Drive is going to happen on the GBPAUD there is a powerfull supply from the past(fresh FTR) i will show the result","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#205","p":9,"im":["eda664bf05eb5d073a87eb68bcac7734167cd41b"],"m":205},{"id":"3drive_p9_206","t":"hey\n\nand this is the result maybe we can call it 4Drive!! but i think the concept is the same and it worked well at the zone","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#206","p":9,"im":["22e365b1a76ce3cffc5396d534a8fb206260062e"],"m":206},{"id":"3drive_p9_207","t":"HI RTM i am here now here is my first attempt in 3D\n\nSALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#207","p":9,"im":["0092b744967b9793229db739a6780e4e2ec65dbb"],"m":207},{"id":"3drive_p9_208","t":"2.\n\nSALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#208","p":9,"im":["0890cb0621eb1360ffdfb34c6c6d5e11dbcd8367"],"m":208},{"id":"3drive_p9_209","t":"3.\n\nSALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#209","p":9,"im":["177d07c6db6a95a6e175f8f201aff1edac180349"],"m":209},{"id":"3drive_p9_210","t":"4. this one is combine of 3 DRIVE with other concepts of RTM\n\nSALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#210","p":9,"im":["d7b0a168a45f6bb80effbaab0d0b265e13ca9511"],"m":210},{"id":"3drive_p9_211","t":"5.\n\nSALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#211","p":9,"im":["f04134fb70a7c695ce2a71c2d3a91a9c6bae9106"],"m":211},{"id":"3drive_p9_212","t":"here is my first 3Drive HW comments are welcome\n\nGUNNER","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#212","p":9,"im":["b710ce80d52fbb3f62a1e8b77bca4d2b8bae3c27"],"m":212},{"id":"3drive_p9_213","t":"Fairly recent 3D on the CADCHF D1. Must say this pattern is hard to find with perfect symmetry.","a":"Fxnewbie","d":"","n":"#213","p":9,"im":["5b287823743ce7791d0c09d9516a267d468cc355"],"m":213},{"id":"3drive_p9_214","t":"After completing my compression homework, the next in line for me (and to complete the approach section in Marketpedia) is the 3Drive. I found this example on the Dollar Index Weekly Chart. 3Drives into supply. Notes are on the chart...\n\nIf we take a look at the PA on the daily chart for the 3Drive from the weekly chart above, it is possible to see more examples of potential 3Drives...\n\nI wish I had the data to take this example down to lower time frames, as it looks like there is a lot of interesting PA in here!\n\nperhaps, 3Drives within a 3Drive, within a 3Drive... like, 3Drive inception?","a":"moogroo","d":"","n":"#214","p":9,"im":["09d94b4eef3c084ff50bf7f7181def884d2c483c","9dde0950f95984671fa6b364ac14af764e247b18"],"m":214},{"id":"3drive_p9_215","t":"Another 3Drive example I found while in forex tester today from 10th oct 2012, AUDUSD. A 3Drive on approach to a 1H FTR / fresh supply seen on the 15min chart...","a":"moogroo","d":"","n":"#215","p":9,"im":["164b70b06e1578d41ec1a4004a8da45bfd078b59"],"m":215},{"id":"3drive_p9_216","t":"Homework Continues...looking at AUDUSD again starting with a drive up to supply the monthly chart that caught my eye, so naturally I wanted to dive in and investigate!","a":"moogroo","d":"","n":"#216","p":9,"im":["71f2b6f2d7667c25cb7d4cc6a94d3fb05b726eef","942f7451a9ccb68cd25a653c0317b7e22bf96ec0","7b8acca03fb3ff7d3e0ca544b5fcc7ef28bed66c"],"m":216},{"id":"3drive_p9_217","t":"Next one! I spotted an approach to a weekly supply area, again on AUDUSD\n\nZooming into the daily chart, we see that the approach was a 3Drive. Where price reacted to through, was not all that clear, with how compressed price looked in the supply area.\n\nBut going into the 1H chart to have a look showed the fresh decision point, where fresh orders clearly existed.\n\nBack to the 3Drive in question, this is the 4H chart...This reveals another 3 drive through the FL..\n\nAnd even in the approach to the RBD of peak [1] and [3] from the daily chart, shows 3Drives on approach in the 1H chart for each of these,\n\nI enjoyed studying and marking this one up today... I think my eyes are becoming more attuned to them and I hope I'm on the right track with these!","a":"moogroo","d":"","n":"#217","p":9,"im":["d2086097ac5405f4ded3f1d3dd9f27c10d951f45","9d5a5ded7652fa37b1c9c860e074e67234b1fbea","99f4522aa67039d060ab77f87471c559eac8f1df","a02ea9131cda58693aad6b26959645b12917f4f3","b9e263cd8cdb5a4bd82b724fdb27b46c4a80636f","9a6da0929f4137b84bf330d9910cb421ba84f243"],"m":217},{"id":"3drive_p9_218","t":"Continuing with the 3Drive homework... I'm trying to look at the overall picture while doing these homeworks, I feel like each homework topic should build on the previous...\n\nThis one is investigating an approach seen on the UJ monthly chart...\n\nThis is the past leading up to the approach shown on the weekly chart...\n\nThe approach shown here on the daily chart...\n\nAnd the reaction...","a":"moogroo","d":"","n":"#218","p":9,"im":["9eb254465e0b2db833485135c0a4a4e78a372f51","88d54a4500cc8fc7be4494549379bc5c656396e9","be8c366e3f2da1dacfbf32296098d2d1e8483324","c1bf837bc30577eb24e7000ecffc373102660bb9"],"m":218},{"id":"3drive_p9_219","t":"NYMEX Crude 1H, 5M (1M inset)","a":"Shantala","d":"","n":"#219","p":9,"im":["ac0d146efa52924d17831c523775ec7989d07003","13e781288ecf27fd22d17b05e74712c5611ae668"],"m":219},{"id":"3drive_p9_220","t":"USDJPY 1H","a":"Subananthan","d":"","n":"#220","p":9,"im":["a7ac78be6442ad169c63262ba7496145d992307f"],"m":220},{"id":"3drive_p9_221","t":"Any correction in my 3D?feel free to reply","a":"Aek0","d":"","n":"#221","p":9,"im":["4a01c59ce5174078ba4957f47fe0c8eec373aac6","22abc872537899c21521cd045ba2bd4496b8c1df"],"m":221},{"id":"3drive_p9_222","t":"Aek0 wrote: Any correction in my 3D?feel free to reply\n\nDo we need compression at 3D? \"Compressing into S/D\"","a":"Shantala","d":"","n":"#222","p":9,"im":["579025fb564a76c93be4cbec10d083bf4c5662e4"],"m":222},{"id":"3drive_p9_223","t":"still have many fresh demand(picture above) so it is not CP, sorry if I'm wrong because I'm still new to these","a":"Aek0","d":"","n":"#223","p":9,"im":["3ef5a42102d6e96cd91b4eab44ab3ca796026d8b"],"m":223},{"id":"3drive_p9_224","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#224","p":9,"im":["3024094f6e6f2c3cf2bcbb93feaecc2ea7c5a73d"],"m":224},{"id":"3drive_p9_225","t":"just started reading 3D HW. and have some charts to share.","a":"Mukhcin","d":"","n":"#225","p":9,"im":["8cd18f8baa8ded7cf837cb8c02c88fa0015e2cd0"],"m":225}],"images":[{"k":"3a93e7953cbd7694dae9165d8af961dccebb2ef3","t":"assets/thumbs/3a93e7953cbd7694dae9165d8af961dccebb2ef3.webp","f":"assets/images/3a93e7953cbd7694dae9165d8af961dccebb2ef3.png","w":1095,"h":643,"b":54504,"o":"3a93e7953cbd7694dae9165d8af961dccebb2ef3.png","p":9,"pid":"3drive_p9_201"},{"k":"635d485898356d995b8e7890dc912183cb2198d8","t":"assets/thumbs/635d485898356d995b8e7890dc912183cb2198d8.webp","f":"assets/images/635d485898356d995b8e7890dc912183cb2198d8.png","w":887,"h":643,"b":41323,"o":"635d485898356d995b8e7890dc912183cb2198d8.png","p":9,"pid":"3drive_p9_201"},{"k":"70a9de60ff10274a061d7eadf5546da350a0d522","t":"assets/thumbs/70a9de60ff10274a061d7eadf5546da350a0d522.webp","f":"assets/images/70a9de60ff10274a061d7eadf5546da350a0d522.png","w":1222,"h":746,"b":54793,"o":"70a9de60ff10274a061d7eadf5546da350a0d522.png","p":9,"pid":"3drive_p9_202"}